  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASPIRE program will improve student access, retention, attendance, health and wellbeing in secure and inclusive learning environments in Gourma-Rharous, Timbuktu and Ber Circles, Timbuktu Region, of Mali. Targeted support for the most vulnerable including girls, children living with disabilities and internally displaced children. It will strengthen competence and wellbeing of teachers to provide effective teaching. It will build the capacity of CSOs to engage in dialogue and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
